title: "Formal Proof of Rψ(5,5) ≤ 16 via Resonant SAT Encoding"
abstract: "We provide a vibrationally-constrained SAT encoding of the modified Ramsey problem Rψ(r,s), proving that Rψ(5,5) ≤ 16. The proof uses Tseytin transformations and is verified with LRAT and Lean 4."
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/motanova84/rpsi-proof
keywords: [Ramsey Theory, QCAL, SAT Solvers, Resonance, Frequency Logic, Lean 4, Kissat, LRAT]
